{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791095700, "covers_from": "2026-10-04T06:35:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-04T06:36:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791095760, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-04T06:35:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 13707, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "老舊公寓如何提供改善，讓我們長輩可以輕鬆回家，而不用經過攏長的都更過程", "display_name": "北投代表 Pony🌹", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T06:35:11+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 33143, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "交通", "content": "士林到內湖至善路被規劃的很差\n新增了單車道，但上下班使用率超低\n希望好好檢視重新規劃", "display_name": "士林代表 No.33,143", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T06:35:25+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 11214, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "育兒", "content": "擔心育兒環境不友善，虐童事件越來越多", "display_name": "文山代表 No.11,214", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T06:35:31+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 34163, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "交通", "content": "交通標線下雨天總是很滑，可以提高摩擦係數的標準嗎？", "display_name": "北投代表 No.34,163", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T06:35:39+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 9815, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "交通", "content": "停車空間太小少了 臨沂街路巷子裡路邊找車位要找100年", "display_name": "中正代表 No.9,815", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T06:35:48+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 30187, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "交通", "content": "南港每天早晚上下班塞車都將近兩個小時通勤 果然是無言城市", "display_name": "南港代表 No.30,187", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 33143, "spr